 insert into public.lesson_sections(lesson_id,title,content,order_index) values(l,'How to approach this task','Concession can distinguish formal legitimacy from substantive representation. Notwithstanding means despite and takes a noun phrase. In formal inversion, a fronted negative expression moves the auxiliary before the subject: Rarely has participation alone guaranteed representation. Use such emphasis sparingly.',1),(l,'Worked example','The council’s consultation attracted substantial participation, yet renters were underrepresented. Notwithstanding its procedural openness, the process risked conferring legitimacy on priorities shaped chiefly by homeowners. A revised approach would retain open submissions while commissioning targeted outreach, with independent scrutiny of whose views informed the final decision.',2);
